            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Peace, friends! I mean you no harm, and I’m no servant of Asheviere’s! My name is Konrad. I’m a prince, nephew of Garard, son of Arand and rightful heir to Wesnoth!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("Konrad? I’ve heard of Prince Konrad... You might be he, or you mightn’t."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("You say you’re a friend, an’ that’s worth something at least."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("I’ll give you a chance to prove yerself, boy. We’ve been havin’ trouble with some bestial undead on the isle. Our leader is missing, and without ’er we’re struggling to fight back."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("But the real Konrad’d be a great general; he’d have no trouble beating down the dead. Lead us against the corpses, prince, and we’ll see just how genuine you are. I’ll be watching."),
          },
          {
